{
	"name": "Redirect Aggression",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/light/orbs-hand-gray.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 11th level, your ability to protect those near you grows further. When an enemy within your threatened area makes a melee attack against one of your allies, you can spend your reaction and one exertion point to try and break their assault. Make an arcana check using your spellcasting ability modifier against their combat maneuver DC. On a successful roll, you impose disadvantage to their attacks against that ally until the start of your next turn.</p>",
